<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>智能假人控制台</title>
    <link href="../bootstrap-5.3.0-alpha1-dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --sky-050: #f2fbff;
            --sky-100: #e7f6ff;
            --sky-200: #d1ebff;
            --sky-300: #a7d9ff;
            --sky-400: #65bdf8;
            --sky-500: #2594ea;
            --sky-600: #1d79cb;
            --ink-900: #123044;
            --ink-700: #395367;
            --ink-500: #6a8295;
            --line: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.14);
            --panel: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
            --panel-strong: #ffffff;
            --shadow: 0 22px 48px rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.12);
            --shadow-soft: 0 10px 24px rgba(21, 82, 130, 0.08);
            --success: #1f9d73;
            --success-soft: rgba(31, 157, 115, 0.12);
            --warning: #c17d1f;
            --warning-soft: rgba(193, 125, 31, 0.12);
            --danger: #d14d68;
            --danger-soft: rgba(209, 77, 104, 0.12);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            color: var(--ink-900);
            font-family: "Avenir Next", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(101, 189, 248, 0.24), transparent 32%),
                radial-gradient(circle at right 18%, rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.16), transparent 24%),
                linear-gradient(180deg, #f5fcff 0%, #f3f8fc 48%, #eef5fb 100%);
        }

        body::before {
            content: "";
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            background-image:
                linear-gradient(rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 28px 28px;
            mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24), transparent 82%);
        }

        .topbar {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 20;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            background: rgba(247, 252, 255, 0.82);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(21, 82, 130, 0.05);
        }

        .page-shell {
            max-width: 1500px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 24px;
        }

        .topbar-inner {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 18px;
            min-height: 78px;
        }

        .brand-wrap {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .brand-mark {
            width: 42px;
            height: 42px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7bd3ff 0%, #2594ea 100%);
            color: #fff;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            font-weight: 800;
            box-shadow: 0 16px 26px rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.22);
        }

        .brand-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        }

        .brand-subtitle {
            margin-top: 2px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--ink-500);
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .nav-link-flat {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 42px;
            padding: 0 16px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            color: var(--ink-700);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: all 0.18s ease;
        }

        .nav-link-flat:hover,
        .nav-link-flat.is-active {
            color: var(--sky-600);
            background: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.1);
            border-color: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.12);
        }

        .page {
            padding: 26px 24px 34px;
        }

        .hero {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(300px, 0.85fr);
            gap: 22px;
            padding: 28px;
            border-radius: 28px;
            background:
                linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.97) 0%, rgba(240, 250, 255, 0.96) 52%, rgba(222, 242, 255, 0.96) 100%);
            border: 1px solid rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.1);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        }

        .hero::before,
        .hero::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            border-radius: 999px;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .hero::before {
            width: 380px;
            height: 380px;
            right: -120px;
            top: -180px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(101, 189, 248, 0.32), transparent 70%);
        }

        .hero::after {
            width: 280px;
            height: 280px;
            right: 80px;
            bottom: -170px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.18), transparent 72%);
        }

        .hero-copy,
        .hero-side {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .hero-kicker {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            min-height: 34px;
            padding: 0 14px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.11);
            color: var(--sky-600);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .hero-title {
            margin: 18px 0 10px;
            font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 42px);
            line-height: 1.1;
            letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            max-width: 820px;
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--ink-700);
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .hero-toolbar {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 24px;
        }

        .hero-side {
            align-self: stretch;
            display: grid;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .hero-side-card {
            padding: 18px 18px 16px;
            border-radius: 22px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
            border: 1px solid rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.1);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
        }

        .hero-side-label {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--ink-500);
        }

        .hero-side-value {
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--ink-900);
        }

        .hero-side-text {
            margin-top: 8px;
            color: var(--ink-700);
            line-height: 1.7;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .action-btn,
        .flat-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            min-height: 42px;
            padding: 0 16px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.12);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
            color: var(--ink-900);
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: transform 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease, background 0.18s ease, border-color 0.18s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(21, 82, 130, 0.08);
        }

        .action-btn:hover,
        .flat-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            background: #ffffff;
            border-color: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.22);
            box-shadow: 0 16px 26px rgba(21, 82, 130, 0.1);
            color: var(--ink-900);
        }

        .flat-btn-primary {
            color: #fff;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #37a7f8 0%, #1e7fd2 100%);
            border-color: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.26);
            box-shadow: 0 16px 26px rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.2);
        }

        .flat-btn-primary:hover {
            color: #fff;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c9af0 0%, #166eb9 100%);
        }

        .flat-btn-success {
            color: #147453;
            background: rgba(31, 157, 115, 0.1);
            border-color: rgba(31, 157, 115, 0.14);
        }

        .flat-btn-warning {
            color: #9b6619;
            background: rgba(193, 125, 31, 0.1);
            border-color: rgba(193, 125, 31, 0.14);
        }

        .flat-btn-danger {
            color: #b33d58;
            background: rgba(209, 77, 104, 0.1);
            border-color: rgba(209, 77, 104, 0.14);
        }

        .flat-btn-danger:hover,
        .flat-btn-warning:hover,
        .flat-btn-success:hover {
            color: inherit;
        }

        .summary-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
            margin: 22px 0 24px;
        }

        .summary-card,
        .panel {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-radius: 22px;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            background: var(--panel);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
        }

        .summary-card {
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .summary-card::before,
        .panel::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0 auto auto 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.28), transparent);
        }

        .summary-card-head {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .summary-label {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--ink-500);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        }

        .summary-dot {
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8edbff 0%, #2d99eb 100%);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.08);
        }

        .summary-value {
            margin-top: 14px;
            font-size: 34px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        }

        .summary-foot {
            margin-top: 6px;
            color: var(--ink-700);
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .notice {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            pointer-events: none;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            padding: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease;
        }

        .notice.show {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
            pointer-events: auto;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
        }

        .notice-success {
            background: rgba(31, 157, 115, 0.1);
            color: #14664a;
            border-color: rgba(31, 157, 115, 0.14);
        }

        .notice-error {
            background: rgba(209, 77, 104, 0.1);
            color: #9f2e49;
            border-color: rgba(209, 77, 104, 0.14);
        }

        .layout-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 430px minmax(0, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
            align-items: start;
        }

        .stack {
            display: grid;
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .panel {
            padding: 22px;
        }

        .panel-head {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .panel-title {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }

        .panel-subtitle {
            margin-top: 8px;
            color: var(--ink-700);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.75;
        }

        .panel-chip {
            padding: 7px 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.1);
            color: var(--sky-600);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .soft-block {
            padding: 14px 16px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(231, 246, 255, 0.72), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.74));
            border: 1px solid rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.1);
        }

        .soft-block-title {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            color: var(--ink-500);
        }

        .soft-block-value {
            margin-top: 8px;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: var(--ink-900);
            word-break: break-all;
        }

        .form-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .field {
            display: grid;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .field-wide {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
        }

        .form-label {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--ink-700);
        }

        .form-control,
        .form-select {
            min-height: 46px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.14);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98);
            color: var(--ink-900);
            box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
        }

        .form-control:focus,
        .form-select:focus,
        .form-check-input:focus {
            border-color: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.34);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.09);
        }

        textarea.form-control {
            min-height: 132px;
            resize: vertical;
            padding-top: 12px;
        }

        .form-check {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            min-height: 46px;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.06);
            border: 1px solid rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.08);
        }

        .form-check-input {
            margin: 0;
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            border-color: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.2);
        }

        .form-check-input:checked {
            background-color: var(--sky-500);
            border-color: var(--sky-500);
        }

        .form-check-label {
            color: var(--ink-900);
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .form-help {
            margin-top: 8px;
            color: var(--ink-500);
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.75;
        }

        .hint-line {
            margin-top: 10px;
            color: var(--ink-700);
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .config-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 12px;
            align-items: stretch;
        }

        .config-item {
            height: 100%;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98), rgba(244, 251, 255, 0.95));
            border: 1px solid rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.1);
        }

        .config-item strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--ink-900);
        }

        .config-item code {
            display: block;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            word-break: break-word;
            color: var(--ink-700);
            background: transparent;
            padding: 0;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.75;
        }

        .config-note {
            margin-top: 12px;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.08);
            color: var(--ink-700);
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.75;
        }

        .panel-wide-section {
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .selected-bar {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .selected-summary {
            color: var(--ink-700);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.75;
        }

        .toolbar {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .table-wrap {
            overflow: auto;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.1);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
        }

        .control-table {
            width: 100%;
            min-width: 1080px;
            border-collapse: separate;
            border-spacing: 0;
        }

        .control-table thead th {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1;
            padding: 15px 16px;
            background: rgba(235, 247, 255, 0.94);
            color: var(--ink-700);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.1);
        }

        .control-table tbody td {
            padding: 15px 16px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.08);
            vertical-align: top;
            color: var(--ink-900);
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .control-table tbody tr:hover {
            background: rgba(242, 251, 255, 0.84);
        }

        .row-actions {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .role-name {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--ink-900);
            line-height: 1.5;
            word-break: break-word;
        }

        .role-meta {
            margin-top: 6px;
            color: var(--ink-500);
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .role-empty {
            color: var(--ink-500);
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .row-action {
            min-height: 36px;
            padding: 0 12px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .status-badge,
        .meta-pill {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 28px;
            padding: 0 10px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .status-ok {
            color: #117252;
            background: var(--success-soft);
        }

        .status-warn {
            color: #9b6619;
            background: var(--warning-soft);
        }

        .status-bad {
            color: #a73650;
            background: var(--danger-soft);
        }

        .meta-stack {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .meta-pill {
            color: var(--sky-600);
            background: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.1);
        }

        .meta-pill.muted {
            color: var(--ink-700);
            background: rgba(106, 130, 149, 0.1);
        }

        .account-code {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 6px 10px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: rgba(18, 48, 68, 0.05);
            color: var(--ink-900);
            font-size: 13px;
            word-break: break-all;
        }

        .account-meta {
            margin-top: 8px;
            color: var(--ink-500);
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .account-meta strong {
            color: var(--ink-700);
        }

        .empty-state {
            padding: 32px 18px;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--ink-500);
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .text-muted {
            color: var(--ink-500) !important;
        }

        @media (max-width: 1260px) {
            .hero {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .layout-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 920px) {
            .summary-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            }

            .form-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .config-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            }

            .selected-bar,
            .topbar-inner {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: stretch;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 680px) {
            .page-shell,
            .page {
                padding-left: 14px;
                padding-right: 14px;
            }

            .hero,
            .panel {
                border-radius: 22px;
                padding: 18px;
            }

            .summary-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .config-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .hero-title {
                font-size: 28px;
            }

            .nav-links,
            .hero-toolbar,
            .toolbar {
                width: 100%;
            }

            .action-btn,
            .flat-btn {
                width: 100%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="topbar">
        <div class="page-shell topbar-inner">
            <div class="brand-wrap">
                <div class="brand-mark">AI</div>
                <div>
                    <div class="brand-title">智能假人控制台</div>
                    <div class="brand-subtitle">批量生成、导入、登录、成品准备与降妖一体化面板</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="/home" class="nav-link-flat is-active">首页</a>
                <a href="/config" class="nav-link-flat">配置页</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page page-shell">
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="hero-copy">
                <div class="hero-kicker">Batch Control</div>
                <h1 class="hero-title">批量管理账号，同时把建角策略真正贯通到登录流程</h1>
                <p class="hero-subtitle">
                    现在首页会把账号生成、角色名策略、账号导入、单账号控制和批量控制放进一套更清晰的天蓝色工作台里。
                    批量生成的新账号会携带建角策略，首次登录时就能真正随机生成角色名，不再落回默认逻辑。
                </p>
                <div class="hero-toolbar">
                    <button id="refreshPageBtn" class="action-btn">刷新列表</button>
                    <button id="loginAllBtn" class="action-btn flat-btn-primary">全部登录</button>
                    <button id="logoutAllBtn" class="action-btn">全部退出</button>
                    <button id="xiangyaoAllBtn" class="action-btn">全部降妖</button>
                    <button id="exitBtn" class="action-btn flat-btn-danger">停止进程</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-side">
                <div class="hero-side-card">
