                        </div>
                        <div class="field field-wide">
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="generateAutoLogin" checked>
                                <label class="form-check-label" for="generateAutoLogin">生成后自动登录这些账号</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-help">角色名和性别策略只会在该账号没有角色、首次触发建角时生效。</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="field field-wide">
                            <button id="generateAccountsBtn" class="flat-btn flat-btn-primary w-100">生成到控制列表</button>
                            <div class="hint-line">适合统一补号、补空号，也适合一批新号一起进列表后再做登录和成品准备。</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
